<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://kottke.org/26/10/0049802-bastardica">Kottke recently pointed me</a> to <a href="https://bastardica.mitpit.com/">Bastardica, &#8220;a foundry for bastard web fonts&#8221;</a>, which I enjoyed reviewing with much relish, although I couldn&#8217;t imagine ever using one.</p>



